        "title": "refactor(deadcode): delete package and script exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe enforced Knip dead-export ratchet still carried 120 stale `packages/*` and `scripts/*` entries, masking dead code and making the shrink-only baseline harder to maintain.\n\nCloses #105733.\nRelated to #105595.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Removed or localized unused package and script exports, companion declarations, and test-only code.\n- Preserved published gateway package entrypoints by mirroring their `package.json` export maps in `config/knip.config.ts`.\n- Marked intentional repository-internal script and directly tested implementation contracts with Knip's `@internal` tag.\n- Regenerated the baseline immediately before push: 32 package entries and 88 script entries removed; 5,772 entries remain after concurrent main cleanups.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo public API or CLI behavior change. Published package export maps and the plugin SDK surface remain unchanged; internal dead code and ratchet debt are reduced.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `pnpm deadcode:exports:update` — final generation byte-stable on `1c33c52f1b37de23d2f39ff4858f1d729cf708e1`.\n- `pnpm deadcode:exports` — 5,772-entry baseline matched.\n- `pnpm plugin-sdk:surface:check` — 345 entrypoints, 11,219 exports, zero forbidden package subpaths.\n- Focused Testbox suite — 19 files, 4 Vitest shards, 376 tests passed (`tbx_01kxcd1p3cy057rgwxah7b6sgs`; [run](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29214834599)).\n- `pnpm check:changed` — passed, including formatting, shrinkwrap guard, SDK baselines, typechecks, and lint (`tbx_01kxcbaf904168v29zc5nvzj3n`; 10m58s; [run](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29213856022)).\n- `.agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode local` — clean; no accepted/actionable findings.\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n\nChangelog omitted: internal dead-code cleanup only.\n",
